 "remarks": "A beautifully refined Colonial offering 2,695 square feet of thoughtfully designed living space, plus an additional 485 square feet in the finished lower level. Privately sited on a .21-acre property bordering Birchwood Country Club, this home is located on a quiet street just moments from Saugatuck and downtown Westport. A charming front porch welcomes you into a home that was thoughtfully renovated and expanded in 2013, blending timeless design with modern comfort. Sun-filled interiors, quality craftsmanship, & an effortless floor plan create an ideal setting for both everyday living & entertaining. The heart of the home is the bright chef's kitchen, which opens seamlessly to the family room & overlooks the patio & fully fenced backyard, perfect for indoor-outdoor living. The residence features four bedrooms, four full baths, & one half bath, including a spacious primary suite with walk-in closets & a spa-inspired bath. Three additional bedrooms & two full baths complete the second floor. A generous mudroom adds convenience, while the finished lower level offers exceptional flexibility with a recreation room, full bath, & dedicated home office.Surrounded by mature landscaping & set in a peaceful, private setting, this property is just minutes from Saugatuck Center, Metro-North, & the shopping & dining of downtown Westport. A polished & sophisticated offering, it seamlessly combines classic architecture, modern livability, & an exceptional location. Welcome home!",
